// CR-2026-008: per-vehicle classification review + audit record.
// This is a REVIEW PROJECTION + audit trail, NOT a second source of operational
// truth — the operational class lives on Vehicle.serviceClass/weightClass and is
// written only on staff confirm. Captures: suggestion, confidence, source,
// reviewer, reviewedAt, and the final confirmed class.
